// Base95 - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# Base95 of "Hello World!", using printable ASCII 33..127 inclusive.
# Two characters are written as <~ and ~>, which is why they are
# escaped here rather than emitted raw.
87cURD]i,"Ebo80
